1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:06,180
The question you just asked ChatGPT set off billions of calculations, for every word of the answer.

2
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:07,380
Let's slow it down.

3
00:00:07,510 --> 00:00:09,180
Zero milliseconds. You hit Enter.

4
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:12,770
Your words get chopped into tokens, and each one becomes a number.

5
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:16,620
Each number lands on a map of meaning, where king sits right next to queen.

6
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,720
Your prompt races to a data centre.

7
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:20,350
Thousands of chips light up.

8
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:24,080
Then, attention. Every word looks at the others, to work out what you mean.

9
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:25,470
It doesn't look up an answer.

10
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:26,820
It guesses the next word.

11
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:29,800
It picks one, then guesses again, one piece at a time.

12
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:31,180
Here's the twist.

13
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:33,430
There's no answer stored inside.

14
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:38,170
It's the world's most powerful autocomplete, trained on mountains of text from the internet.

15
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:39,820
That reply wasn't looked up.

16
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:40,680
It was predicted.

17
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:41,730
Follow for more.
